e hain 9."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, nau aur nine dono ka numeral 9 hai! Ab 6 aur 9 ka fark dekhein. Dono ko alag kaise pehchaanoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… 6 neeche gol hai… aur 9 upar gol hai!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne kaha 6 ka gol neeche aur 9 ka gol upar hai. Board par 6 aur 9 isi tarah dikhte hain. Agar 6 ko ulta kar dein, kya woh ab bhi chhah rahega?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi... agar 6 ulta karo toh 9 ban jaata hai... toh chhah nahi rahega na."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ulta 6 ab 9 banega, chhah nahi. Ab cricket mein zero bhi kaam aata hai. Batsman bina koi run banaye out ho, toh uska score kya hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... out?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, batsman out hua. Par score matlab kitne run banaye. Ek bhi run nahi banaya, toh score kitna hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"duck? matlab zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, cricket mein duck matlab zero run! Zero batata hai ki ek bhi run nahi bana. Ab do rotiyaan thi, dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"ek?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne ek bola. Socho, ek roti khaayi toh ek bachti; dono khaayi toh koi roti nahi bachti. Taar par teen chidiya hain, teeno udd gayin. Ab kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero? kyunki... ek bhi nahi bachi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek bhi chidiya nahi bachi, isliye zero. Ab ulta ginte hain: teen, do, ek. Iske baad kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... do?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne do bola. Ulta ginte hue do, ek se pehle aaya tha; ek ke baad kya hoga, yeh saath sochte hain. Ek bhi cricket run na bane, toh score zero hota hai. Ab teen, do, ek ke baad kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Ab socho, agar koi run hi nahi bana, toh zero number ki zaroorat kyun hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero bolta hai ki kuch bhi nahi bacha... jaise plate khali hai ya koi run nahi bana"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero batata hai ki plate khaali hai ya koi run nahi bana. Ab main eight bolungi; tum ungliyon se utni ginti dikhaoge. Eight ke liye kitni ungliyan dikhaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"haan haan... paanch aur teen... paanch ungli ek haath ki, teen doosre haath ki... total aath"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, paanch aur teen milaakar aath ungliyan hoti hain. Eight aur aath ek hi ginti ke naam hain. Eight bolun toh tum kitni ungliyan dikhaoge?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.06502,"tokens":52705},"boards":7,"lastMs":2727,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["3 2 1 ?","1 run","0 run"],"words":"the board shows writing; written on it: 3 2 1 ?; 1 run; 0 run"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"read":"partly","depth":"untested","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer","plain":true}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"claimed":"understood","evidence":"Easy aur transfer dono mein sahi saat taaliyaan."},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s2":{"read":"partly","depth":"untested","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i02","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i11","kind":"retrieval"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Eight ko aath ungliyon se joda; no grade"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s3":{"read":"partly","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i06","kind":"error_spot"}],"grades":["correct"],"claimed":"understood","evidence":"6 ulta hone par 9 bataya; fark samjhaya"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s4":{"read":"partly","depth":"untested","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i10","kind":"far_transfer","plain":true},{"g":"wrong","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i03","kind":"practice"},{"g":"wrong","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i13","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i13","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i04","kind":"why","plain":true}],"grades":["correct","wrong","wrong","correct","correct"],"claimed":"understood","evidence":"Zero kyun ch